        "value": "無役（むやく）九十三人"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Exempt from service (muyaku): 93 persons. The column stands to the right of the ○高遠藩 marker, so it closes out the preceding Takashima entry rather than opening Takatō's. It pairs with the 在職 (on active duty) count of 220 persons printed on page 237, and both fall inside the bracket that page opens to flag seven lines written in red in the original."
