      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "新田改出高（しんでんあらためだしだか）高千八百二十石三斗一升九合一勺"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Yield newly brought out by re-survey of reclaimed fields = 1,820.3191 koku, the second increment under 内. The label is set as a two-line warichu (新田改 / 出高) at the foot of the column. 89.13 + 1,820.3191 = 1,909.4491, and 34,999.4491 − 1,909.4491 = 33,090.0000 exactly."
